.DS_Store
.superpowers/
outputs/
work/

# The Reader scaffold ships an outputs/ convention doc, and only that. Re-include the directory so the
# doc is reachable, then re-ignore everything inside it and re-include the doc alone, so a reader that
# has actually produced output cannot surface that output as untracked material in the distribution.
# The blanket outputs/ exclusion above is otherwise unchanged.
!template/reader/outputs/
template/reader/outputs/*
!template/reader/outputs/README.md
